  "title": "AV Receives MQ‑31A Designation from Italian Ministry of Defence (MoD)",
  "summary": "ARLINGTON, Va., July, 2026 – AeroVironment, Inc. (“AV”) (NASDAQ: AVAV), a global defense technology leader, today announced that it has received an MQ-31A military designation from Italy’s Directorate of Aeronautical Armaments and Airworthiness (DAAA) to deliver the JUMP® 20 unmanned aircraft system (UAS) to the Italian Army. The MQ‑31A designation confirms that the Italian Ministry of Defence now recognizes JUMP 20 as an official […]",
